      <h2>What About ADSL or 4G/5G Alternatives?</h2>

      <h3>ADSL (Asymmetric Digital Subscriber Line):</h3>
      <p>If fiber isn't available, ADSL is the backup in most areas. Speed: 10–25 Mbps. Cost: €20–30/month.</p>

      <p>ADSL is adequate for email, calls, and browsing, but slow for large file uploads or simultaneous video calls. Acceptable for light remote work.</p>

      <h3>4G/5G Mobile Hotspot:</h3>
      <p>Spanish mobile plans with unlimited data: €20–40/month. Speed: 20–100 Mbps (variable). Most providers offer:</p>
