        <details>
          <summary>Is 5G internet available in Spain as home internet?</summary>
          <div class="msv__faq-answer">
            <p>5G home internet is emerging (Vodafone, Orange offer it). Speeds reach 100+ Mbps. However, fiber is still faster and cheaper. 5G home internet works well as a backup or in areas without fiber.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
